{"4871750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1/16384", "steam_appid": 4871750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 / 16384 is a minimalist probability game where you pull the lever, press three buttons, and hope for triple 7s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the feel of Japanese slot machines, it focuses on the simple tension of the lever, the stop buttons, and the moment the reels line up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex controls and no complicated rules.<br>The result is decided when you pull the lever, and each button stops one reel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is all.<br>But the numbers are recorded. The history stays. The odds keep staring back at you.<br>And somehow, one more pull always feels reasonable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls: one lever and three buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1 / 16384 jackpot for triple 7s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Records and statistics for each matching number</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily history and all-time records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare effects inspired by Japanese slot culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 / 16384 is a minimalist probability game where you pull the lever, press three buttons, and hope for triple 7s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the feel of Japanese slot machines, it focuses on the simple tension of the lever, the stop buttons, and the moment the reels line up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex controls and no complicated rules.<br>The result is decided when you pull the lever, and each button stops one reel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is all.<br>But the numbers are recorded. The history stays. The odds keep starin